{"title":"Medical Representative Roadmap","role":"Medical Representative","summary":"A Medical Representative (MR), also called a Medical Representative Executive / Pharmaceutical Sales Executive, represents pharmaceutical and healthcare companies to healthcare professionals and other authorized customers.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Pharm (Bachelor of Pharmacy)","Course":"Pharmaceutical Sciences"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Medical Representative (MR), also called a Medical Representative Executive / Pharmaceutical Sales Executive, represents pharmaceutical and healthcare companies to healthcare professionals and other authorized customers."},{"type":"p","text":"The role combines pharmaceutical knowledge, scientific communication, sales, territory management, relationship building, product promotion, market analysis, and business development."},{"type":"p","text":"A B.Pharm graduate has a strong foundation in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmaceutics"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmacology"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmaceutical chemistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmacognosy"},{"type":"h","text":"Biochemistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical pharmacy"},{"type":"h","text":"Drug mechanisms"},{"type":"h","text":"Dosage forms"},{"type":"h","text":"Adverse drug reactions"},{"type":"h","text":"Basic therapeutics"},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest MR candidates convert this scientific foundation into accurate, ethical and effective product communication."},{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"A Medical Representative is primarily a pharmaceutical-industry sales and scientific-communication role. The role does not authorize independent diagnosis or prescribing. Product promotion and communication must follow applicable pharmaceutical marketing, professional, advertising and regulatory requirements."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","bloc