 strong fundamentals in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Human anatomy"},{"type":"h","text":"Physiology"},{"type":"h","text":"Biochemistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmaceutical chemistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmaceutics"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmacognosy"},{"type":"h","text":"Basic computer skills"},{"type":"h","text":"Communication"},{"type":"p","text":"Start learning how medicines move through:"},{"type":"h","text":"Drug"},{"type":"h","text":"Dosage Form"},{"type":"h","text":"Administration"},{"type":"h","text":"Absorption"},{"type":"h","text":"Distribution"},{"type":"h","text":"Metabolism"},{"type":"h","text":"Excretion"},{"type":"h","text":"Therapeutic Effect"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop professional communication from the beginning."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Pharmacology & Therapeutics"},{"type":"h","text":"Focus heavily on:"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmacology"},{"type":"h","text":"Pathophysiology"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmacokinetics"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmacodynamics"},{"type":"h","text":"Medicinal chemistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Microbiology"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmaceutical analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Understand major therapeutic areas:"},{"type":"h","text":"Cardiovascular"},{"type":"h","text":"Diabetes"},{"type":"h","text":"Respiratory"},{"type":"h","text":"Gastrointestinal"},{"type":"h","text":"CNS"},{"type":"h","text":"Anti-infectives"},{"type":"h","text":"Pain management"},{"type":"h","text":"Dermatology"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn to explain a medicine using:"},{"type":"h","text":"Disease"},{"type":"h","text":"Treatment Objective"},{"type":"h","text":"Drug Class"},{"type":"h","text":"Mechanism of Action"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Benefit"},{"type":"h","text":"Safety / Adverse Effects"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient / Prescriber Considerations"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Build Commercial Skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Start combining pharmacy with business."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmaceutical marketing"},{"type"